The '''Cestra''' is a [[Corpus]]-built sidearm added in {{ver|11}}. In essence, It is a scaled-down version of the {{Weapon|Supra}}, where it has a brief spooling period before reaching its maximum fire rate.

This weapon can be sold for {{cc|5,000}}; it is also a [[weapon crafting ingredient]] for {{Weapon|Dual Cestra}} (x2).
{{Checklist|nocategory=true|
* {{Weapon|Cestra}} + {{Weapon|Cestra}} → {{Weapon|Dual Cestra}}
}}

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Puncture}} damage.

{{Advantages|
*Very high accuracy.
}}

{{Disadvantages|
*Projectiles have travel time.
*Requires a spool-up of '''6''' shots before optimal [[fire rate]] is achieved. Fire rate starts at '''60%''' of the listed value, and increases by '''8%''' per shot.
*High recoil when fully spooled.
*Poor ammo economy.
}}
{{WeaponComparison|Dual Cestra}}

==Acquisition==
The Cestra's blueprint can be purchased from the [[Market]] for 20,000 credits, while the built version can be purchased for 175 platinum (catalyst installed) . Alternatively, it can be acquired from completing the [[Jupiter]] to [[Europa]] [[Junction]].

{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

